		{ "bar": 2, "beat": 3, "y": 1, "type": "Comment", "tab": "Actions", "text": "Active dialogues (2/3)\nIf you leave freeze behaviour empty, it defaults to \"Prolong\", which is usually what we want anyways. So basically you only ever need to specify the unfreeze behaviour", "color": "F2E644", "show": false },
